### Test Secure Registration
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe"
}

### Test Admin Approval (First login as admin)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fiacrepcc@gmail.com",
  "password": "SecureAdminPass123!"
}

### Get Pending Users (Admin only)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/pending-users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve User (Admin only)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/approve-user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{pendingUserId}}"
}

### Test Login Before Approval (Should fail)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Test Login After Approval (Should succeed)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}